    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17727" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fartim</span></b> , adv.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>by stuffing</i> or <i>cramming;</i> hence, <i>closely</i>, <i>densely</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tectum omne fartim stipaverant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 3, p. 130, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">isicium fartim concisum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>cut up fine as if for stuffing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2</span></i>
			, p. 117, 30.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
